    "KunThai can provide records, guidance, alerts, reports, and support workflows. It cannot physically prevent crime, accidents, unsafe driving, product defects, or misconduct in the real world.": "KunThai can provide records, guidance, alerts, reports, and support workflows. It cannot physically prevent crime, accidents, unsafe driving, product defects, or misconduct in the real world.",
    "KunThai cannot guarantee response time.": "KunThai cannot guarantee response time.",
    "KunThai complies with applicable child-safety laws and lawful reporting duties. When required, KunThai reports confirmed CSAM to the National Center for Missing & Exploited Children (NCMEC) or to the relevant regional child-protection or law-enforcement authority.": "KunThai complies with applicable child-safety laws and lawful reporting duties. When required, KunThai reports confirmed CSAM to the National Center for Missing & Exploited Children (NCMEC) or to the relevant regional child-protection or law-enforcement authority.",
