    "KunThai does not claim full compliance with a specific accessibility standard until a qualified audit confirms it. Some features may still need improvement.": "KunThai does not claim full compliance with a specific accessibility standard until a qualified audit confirms it. Some features may still need improvement.",
    "KunThai does not disclose personal information indiscriminately. We disclose it when needed to provide a requested service, follow your direction, operate safely, work with processors, complete a business change, or meet legal obligations.": "KunThai does not disclose personal information indiscriminately. We disclose it when needed to provide a requested service, follow your direction, operate safely, work with processors, complete a business change, or meet legal obligations.",
    "KunThai does not permit exceptions for claimed consent, humor, art, role-play, synthetic or computer-generated imagery, or content that has been edited to hide the age or identity of a child.": "KunThai does not permit exceptions for claimed consent, humor, art, role-play, synthetic or computer-generated imagery, or content that has been edited to hide the age or identity of a child.",
    "KunThai does not sell personal information for money. If a regional law treats certain advertising or analytics disclosures as a sale or sharing, we will provide any controls required by that law.": "KunThai does not sell personal information for money. If a regional law treats certain advertising or analytics disclosures as a sale or sharing, we will provide any controls required by that law.",
    "KunThai is a global service. Personal information may be stored or processed in countries other than the country where you live, including locations used by our hosting, authentication, storage, mapping, moderation, communication, and support providers.": "KunThai is a global service. Personal information may be stored or processed in countries other than the country where you live, including locations used by our hosting, authentication, storage, mapping, moderation, communication, and support providers.",
    "KunThai is designed for users in multiple countries, but features, languages, maps, products, transport options, verification methods, payment tools, and support channels may differ by location. A feature shown in the app is not a promise that it is legally or operationally available everywhere.": "KunThai is designed for users in multiple countries, but features, languages, maps, products, transport options, verification methods, payment tools, and support channels may differ by location. A feature shown in the app is not a promise that it is legally or operationally available everywhere.",
    "KunThai is generally responsible for personal information processed to operate the platform. Independent sellers, transport operators, payment providers, sign-in providers, and other organizations may separately control information they collect for their own services. Their privacy notices may also apply.": "KunThai is generally responsible for personal information processed to operate the platform. Independent sellers, transport operators, payment providers, sign-in providers, and other organizations may separately control information they collect for their own services. Their privacy notices may also apply.",
    "KunThai is not a police service, ambulance service, fire service, emergency dispatcher, insurer, or physical security provider.": "KunThai is not a police service, ambulance service, fire service, emergency dispatcher, insurer, or physical security provider.",
    "KunThai is not directed to children below {legal.minimumAge}, and a higher minimum age may apply in some countries. We do not knowingly permit a child below the applicable minimum age to maintain a standard KunThai account.": "KunThai is not directed to children below {legal.minimumAge}, and a higher minimum age may apply in some countries. We do not knowingly permit a child below the applicable minimum age to maintain a standard KunThai account.",
    "KunThai may add, change, test, suspend, or discontinue features to improve safety, reliability, legal compliance, or product quality. We may provide notice when a change materially affects users, but urgent security or legal changes may take effect immediately.": "KunThai may add, change, test, suspend, or discontinue features to improve safety, reliability, legal compliance, or product quality. We may provide notice when a change materially affects users, but urgent security or legal changes may take effect immediately.",
    "KunThai may connect passengers with independent drivers, companies, fleets, or transport operators and may provide booking, route, fare, location, safety, and support tools. Unless a separate written agreement says otherwise, the transport provider—not KunThai—performs the physical transport service.": "KunThai may connect passengers with independent drivers, companies, fleets, or transport operators and may provide booking, route, fare, location, safety, and support tools. Unless a separate written agreement says otherwise, the transport provider—not KunThai—performs the physical transport service.",
    "KunThai may depend on independent providers for sign-in, hosting, storage, maps, directions, content moderation, notifications, communications, analytics, verification, and payments. Their services may be governed by separate terms and privacy notices.": "KunThai may depend on independent providers for sign-in, hosting, storage, maps, directions, content moderation, notifications, communications, analytics, verification, and payments. Their services may be governed by separate terms and privacy notices.",
    "KunThai may disclose limited information when there is a credible emergency involving risk of death, serious physical injury, child safety, or other urgent harm, where legally permitted.": "KunThai may disclose limited information when there is a credible emergency involving risk of death, serious physical injury, child safety, or other urgent harm, where legally permitted.",
